- P. R. Amestoy, T. A. Davis and I. S. Duff (1996), An approximate minimum degree ordering algorithm, SIAM Journal on Matrix Analysis and Applications, 17(4), 886–905. https://doi.org/10.1137/S0895479894278952
- J. W. H. Liu (1990), The role of elimination trees in sparse factorization, SIAM Journal on Matrix Analysis and Applications, 11(1), 134–172. https://doi.org/10.1137/0611010
